1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:01,470
M: Hey, congratulations.

2
00:00:02,430 --> 00:00:09,235
I just heard from Mr. Shaw that the directors have come to a decision regarding the proposal you gave at this morning's meeting.

3
00:00:09,590 --> 00:00:14,055
W: Yes, I just heard the news myself, and you wouldn't believe how relieved I am.

4
00:00:14,330 --> 00:00:21,790
I mean, considering the number of days and nights the guys on our team worked to prepare for this morning's presentation, I had to get the approval.

5
00:00:22,750 --> 00:00:25,950
I was so afraid that I would not be able to convince the directors.

6
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:28,350
But, I guess I did all right.

7
00:00:28,650 --> 00:00:29,450
M: Are you kidding?

8
00:00:29,765 --> 00:00:30,470
It was perfect.

9
00:00:31,110 --> 00:00:33,810
I thought it was one of the best speeches you have ever given.

10
00:00:34,565 --> 00:00:40,370
In fact, I wasn't too sure about the possibility of the project myself until I heard your speech.

11
00:00:41,075 --> 00:00:42,310
You really did a good job.

12
00:00:42,935 --> 00:00:43,210
W: Thanks.

13
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:45,550
I owe it all to my staff.

14
00:00:46,135 --> 00:00:47,250
This calls for a celebration.
